      "raw": "<p>Since I just came back, I see no reason to not start another event. However, let&#39;s try something a little sillier this time.</p><p>The goal of this game is to insert the names of the different SotM cards into your daily conversation.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><u style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Rules</u></p><p>-Each player must choose one&nbsp;<em>hero&nbsp;</em>deck (no <em>villain </em>decks this time).</p><p>-The player will try to say each card name of that deck in their daily conversation.</p><p>-You cannot be talking about SotM at the time.</p><p>-The name must fit into the conversation. You can&#39;t run up to someone and scream &quot;Stun Bolt!&quot; (hmm...good idea for a different game.)</p><p>-If you manage to say a card name, please post the context and line into this thread.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>If anyone has any suggestions please list them below.</p><p>If anyone can rank the difficulty of the different decks for this challenge, that would be great.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>PS Anyone know what event number this is?</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
