    {
      "id": 101344,
      "name": "Pydro",
      "username": "Pydro",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/pydro/{size}/1844_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-05-06T20:33:22.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Reckless\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/reckless/48/2467_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Reckless:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Welcome back, Pydro. The place wasn’t the same without you!</p>\n<p>This also sounds fun. What exactly do we need to do? Just get a deck set up to the side and post when our turn comes up?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I was thinking that you have to use the phrases in real life, and post the lines you used here whenever it happens.</p>\n<p>If people want to use them in a running conversation here, we could try that too.</p>",
      "post_number": 7,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:29:54.547Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
